{"acceptance":"Consume a3b-analysis-freeze-v3.json unchanged. Nine NOT_EVALUATED observables stay unavailable. No periodicity/steady-state/predictive claim. Spatial arm changes effective dt and cannot isolate spatial independence.","additional_historical_wrapper_seconds":2.673,"analysis_plan":{"classification":{"converging_monotone":"|delta| decreases in both consecutive pairs and the finest-pair delta meets the tolerance.","observed_order":"p is a diagnostic consistency label only; p in [0.5, 1.5] means 'consistent with first order' and is never an acceptance criterion; p is not computed from non-monotone pairs or ratio != 2.","overall_output":"A sensitivity table with raw deltas, the per-observable classification, and one bounded statement for the studied domain. No global convergence verdict.","per_observable":["CONVERGING_MONOTONE","NON_MONOTONE","NOT_EVALUATED","NOT_CONVERGED"]},"comparison_method":{"aggregation":"Report every cycle index separately and a per-observable summary; do not average cycles before applying the tolerance.","no_interpolation":"No interpolation in cycle index or angle; no Richardson extrapolation as a result, error bound, or acceptance input.","spatial_arm":"At CFL 0.4, compare successive mesh pairs (18 vs 28) and (28 vs 48) at the same cycle index; the finer mesh is the denominator.","temporal_arm":"At 48 cells, compare successive CFL pairs (0.4 vs 0.2) and (0.2 vs 0.1) at the same cycle index; the finer level is the denominator."},"cost_separation":"Exclusive timers per configuration and cycle, shares of wall time, and an explicit single-sample statement. The cost model is validated against the T1 measurements, not assumed.","cycle_indices":[1,2,3],"lineage_requirement":"The analysis-freeze and sensitivity report must consume the parent T1-A cycles 1-2 plus the v3 cycle 3 with an explicit lineage label. A T1-A-only freeze is not a temporal or spatial sensitivity result.","observable_set":["indicated_power_w","indicated_torque_nm","imep_pa","brake_work_j","brake_power_w","brake_torque_nm","bmep_pa","fmep_pa","net_piston_mep_pa","crankcase_gas_work_J","crankcase.mass_kg"],"observable_source":"The audited per-cycle primary produced by make_integrated_cycle_primary; no derived or fitted quantity is added.","report":"One v3 analysis receipt and one v3 sensitivity report under results/integrated-solver-verification-v1/; raw artifacts remain under DINO_ARTIFACT_ROOT.","tolerance_policy":{"atol_freeze_order":{"immutability":"After the v3 analysis-freeze commit, the table cannot be changed; any change requires a new preregistration.","reason":"The base values are produced by this matrix; the numeric table cannot be frozen before the base run exists, but it is frozen before any comparison, which preserves the design intent.","requirement":"The numeric atol_obs table is derived from the combined T1-A cycles 1-3 and committed in results/integrated-solver-verification-v1/a3b-analysis-freeze-v3.json BEFORE any cross-config comparison."},"atol_obs_rule":"atol_obs = max(0.05 * |x_base|, declared_numerical_resolution)","declared_resolution_floors":{"mass_observables_kg":"the frozen conservation-noise floor recorded in the analysis-freeze table, not lower than the A3a observed maximum |mass residual| of 1.2891841457210451e-18 kg","power_torque_pressure_observables":"0 unless the frozen contract declares a resolution; the 5% relative term dominates away from zero","work_observables_J":5e-12},"delta_definition":"Difference between the two compared levels at the same cycle index; denominator is |x_fine|, never the coarse level.","near_zero_rule":"If |x_fine| <= atol_obs, the relative criterion does not apply and only the absolute band governs.","rule":"|delta| <= max(0.05 * |x_fine|, atol_obs)","sign_crossing_rule":"A sign crossing between levels with magnitude > atol_obs is NOT_CONVERGED; a crossing is never a PASS by itself. crankcase_gas_work_J is the declared witness case.","x_base_source":"Base configuration T1-A (48 cells / CFL 0.4) at the same cycle index; for T1-A itself the three combined cycles are the base record, not a cross-configuration comparison."}},"authorization":"Separate owner confirmation must bind protocol, driver, freeze, configs, caps, plans, source/output roots; must be registered by exact authorization SHA in program-status. This protocol is not authorization.","caps":{"T1-B":1050.0,"T1-C":2100.0,"T1-D":310.0,"T1-E":210.0},"claim_boundaries":{"allowed":["Numerical sensitivity of the transient solution over cycles 1-3 at the studied mesh/CFL configurations.","A bounded supported-domain statement only if the preregistered tolerance is met: 'precision numerica soportada a la par malla/CFL estudiada'.","Explicit 'error no acotado - curvas exploratorias, no predictivas' if the tolerance is not met."],"necessary_not_sufficient":"Convergence is necessary but not sufficient; no experimental validation and no predictive claim are made.","not_allowed":["Definitive convergence closure of the solver.","Steady-state convergence or periodicity identification from three cycles.","Any predictive power-curve or torque-curve claim.","Experimental validation.","Extrapolation beyond the studied mesh/CFL domain.","A supported resolution domain from T1-A alone; T1-B..E are required for temporal and spatial sensitivity."],"periodicity":{"detector_use":"The detector may run for recording, but its output is not used as a convergence or acceptance criterion in A3b.","reason":"Three cycles are insufficient for lag1/lag2 periodicity acceptance. A3a with 8 cycles already returned EXECUTED_NO_PERIOD_ACCEPTED (13/13 comparisons failed, accepted_period null, worst lag1 1.31% vs 0.2% threshold).","status":"NOT_EVALUATED_HORIZON_INSUFFICIENT"}},"closure_seconds":10.0,"global_cap_seconds":4320.0,"inherited_ledger_seconds":530.469,"invocation_caps":{"T1-B":600.0,"T1-C":750.0,"T1-D":600.0,"T1-E":600.0},"invocations":{"T1-B":[1,1,1],"T1-C":[1,1,1],"T1-D":[3],"T1-E":[3]},"memory":{"aggregat